{"title": "Anti-Hag Support Group", "pageid": 26341, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Anti-Hag_Support_Group", "categories": ["Factions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Anti-Hag Support Group</b> is a group of survivors who are working to oppose <a href=\"/wiki/Hag\" title=\"Hag\">Hags</a>. They can be found meeting at <a href=\"/wiki/Old_Garlow%27s_Place\" title=\"Old Garlow's Place\">Old Garlow's Place</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldur's Gate</a> during <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a>.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_Three\">Act Three</span></h3>\n<p>The Anti-Hag Support Group is established if the party complete <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Save_Mayrina\" title=\"Save Mayrina\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Save Mayrina\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Save_Mayrina\" title=\"Save Mayrina\">Save Mayrina</a> during <a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a>. Otherwise, the <a href=\"/wiki/Dead_Eyes\" title=\"Dead Eyes\">Dead Eyes</a> can be found at Old Garlow's Place instead.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Members\">Members</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Adrielle\" title=\"Adrielle\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Portrait_Adrielle.png/30px-Portrait_Adrielle.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Portrait_Adrielle.png/45px-Portrait_Adrielle.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Portrait_Adrielle.png/60px-Portrait_Adrielle.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Adrielle\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Portrait_Adrielle.png/30px-Portrait_Adrielle.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Portrait_Adrielle.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Adrielle\" title=\"Adrielle\">Adrielle</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mask_of_Regret_(Overgrown_Tunnel)\" title=\"Mask of Regret (Overgrown Tunnel)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Mask_of_Regret_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png/30px-Portrait_Mask_of_Regret_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Mask_of_Regret_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png/45px-Portrait_Mask_of_Regret_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Mask_of_Regret_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png/60px-Portrait_Mask_of_Regret_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hydrangea Wubb\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Mask_of_Regret_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png/30px-Portrait_Mask_of_Regret_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/df/Portrait_Mask_of_Regret_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mask_of_Regret_(Overgrown_Tunnel)\" title=\"Mask of Regret (Overgrown Tunnel)\">Hydrangea Wubb</a> (if saved in Act One)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jatlo\" title=\"Jatlo\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Portrait_Jatlo.png/30px-Portrait_Jatlo.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Portrait_Jatlo.png/45px-Portrait_Jatlo.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Portrait_Jatlo.png/60px-Portrait_Jatlo.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jatlo\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Portrait_Jatlo.png/30px-Portrait_Jatlo.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Portrait_Jatlo.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jatlo\" title=\"Jatlo\">Jatlo</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kled\" title=\"Kled\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d8/Portrait_Kled.png/30px-Portrait_Kled.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d8/Portrait_Kled.png/45px-Portrait_Kled.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d8/Portrait_Kled.png/60px-Portrait_Kled.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Kled\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d8/Portrait_Kled.png/30px-Portrait_Kled.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d8/Portrait_Kled.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Kled\" title=\"Kled\">Kled</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mayrina\" title=\"Mayrina\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Portrait_Mayrina.png/30px-Portrait_Mayrina.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Portrait_Mayrina.png/45px-Portrait_Mayrina.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Portrait_Mayrina.png/60px-Por